WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.242
One long video. A finished Short.

00:00:02.688 --> 00:00:03.775
In just a few clicks.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:08.940
Here's something most creators get wrong
about Shorts.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.140
They think they need to film new content.
You don't.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:16.380
Your best Shorts are already inside
the long videos you've recorded.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:17.580
Let me show you.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.500
This is the video you're watching
right now, inside Minti Studio.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.100
Here's the transcript. I'll select
the part I just said.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.180
Right here. Click Add.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.860
I'll give it a title.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:31.980
Your best Shorts are already filmed.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.180
And create the clip.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.980
And just like that, I'm inside a Short.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:41.820
Same video, now vertical, with captions.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:45.020
Now let's make it look like mine.
I'll open Design.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:49.420
There are ready-made styles here.
Bold, podcast, word highlight.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.260
I'll pick this one.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.700
I'll make the title background white,
and the text black.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.420
That's better. Here's the part I love.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.420
Click Save as Default,

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:02.780
and every new Short gets this same look
automatically.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.740
You set it up once,
and you never do it again.

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:07.550
Now, framing.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:11.790
With Auto layout, Minti Studio finds
and keeps me centered,

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:13.470
even when I move.

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:17.070
And if it's an interview with two people,
it stacks them,

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:20.670
one on top, one on the bottom,
so nobody gets cut out.

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:23.710
You can also add music, a background,

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:25.950
your logo, or a subscribe button.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.870
Whatever fits your brand.

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:30.670
One long video. A finished Short.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:31.950
In just a few clicks.
